  "description": "SelectPdf is a cross-platform PDF library for .NET (Linux x64 and ARM64, Docker images with no apt-get, Windows, and macOS on Apple Silicon) that creates, edits and reads PDF documents in C# and VB.NET, with no Adobe Acrobat required. It includes an HTML to PDF converter built on Chromium (HTML5, CSS3, web fonts, JavaScript; synchronous or asynchronous) and a Word to PDF converter (DOCX, DOC, RTF, WordML, HTML, Markdown and text). Features: generate PDFs from scratch; load and modify existing PDFs; text, image, HTML, Word, shape, link, attachment and bookmark elements; reusable templates, headers and footers, watermarks and page numbering; merge; resize and reflow; redaction (text, regular expressions, images and areas are removed from the file); AcroForm filling; PDF portfolios; compression; open actions; RC4, AES and AES-GCM encryption up to 256-bit; digital signatures with time stamps and signature validation; PDF/A-1b to PDF/A-4 and PDF/X-1a; tagged, accessible PDF/UA-1 and PDF/UA-2; ZUGFeRD / Factur-X electronic invoices; HTML to image; PDF to text and PDF to image. Runs on .NET 11, .NET 10, .NET 9 and .NET 8, and on .NET Framework 4.6.1+ through .NET Standard 2.0. Install a matching SelectPdf.Universal.Native runtime package (win-x64, win-x86, linux-x64, linux-arm64 or osx-arm64) for the rendering engines.",
