  "readmeFile": "docs\\README.SelectPdf.Universal.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 26.6.0\n- Excel and PowerPoint to PDF (ExcelToPdf, PowerPointToPdf), on pages and in headers and footers (PdfExcelElement, PdfExcelSection, PdfPowerPointElement, PdfPowerPointSection).\n- PDF to Word, Excel and PowerPoint (PdfToWord, PdfToExcel, PdfToPowerPoint).\n- Split documents by page ranges, odd or even pages, page count, bookmarks or file size (PdfSplitManager).\n- Edit the text, images and paths of a page (PdfPage.ObjectModel) and its layers (PdfDocument.Layers).\n- Fill XFA forms, with the form's own scripts running (PdfFormManager, XfaMode).\n- Words with their position and font (PdfToText.GetWords); image extraction (PdfImageExtractor).\n- Check and fix documents for PDF/A, PDF/UA and PDF/X (PdfValidator, PdfPreflight.Fix).\n- Remove scripts, attachments and hidden content (PdfSanitizeManager); describe images for accessibility (PdfAccessibilityManager).\n- Fast Web View: documents saved linearized (PdfDocument.Linearize).\n- Read and remove a document's security (PdfSecurityManager.GetSecurityInfo, RemoveSecurity).\n- Empty signature fields and certification signatures (AddSignatureField, CertificationLevel).\n- Web fonts that load after the page has loaded are waited for (WaitForWebFonts).\n- Word to PDF: SVG pictures as vectors, line spacing, charts, metafiles, fields and fonts closer to Word.\n- Damaged PDF files that other readers open are opened too.\n- Pages with smooth scrolling print a sticky header at the top; right-to-left pages print in place; window.print() no longer stalls a conversion.\n- .NET Framework projects with packages.config (Web Forms, MVC 5) get the engine, the PDF tool and libHarfBuzzSharp.dll in bin.\n- .NET 11 supported.\n- Behavior changes: PDF/X output keeps no links on the page; ConvertToPdfA refuses a signed document; see the full release notes.\n- Full release notes: https://selectpdf.com/pdf-library/html/Release-Notes.htm",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "SelectPdf is a cross-platform PDF library for .NET with state of the art HTML to PDF and Word to PDF converters.",
  "title": "SelectPdf Library for .NET - Cross-Platform (Linux, Docker, ARM64, Windows, macOS): HTML to PDF, Word to PDF",
